                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi edeta vezaru ’diyi ve Yehova dri obiese arikariruri be o’biti vusi azini ondre vusi, azini alu indi yi oti mikate ecetaruri mesa alaruri ma dria, ede vini talapati edele melesiri pie, tala erini be, dizu ondre vusi ondre vusi; amani azi Yehova Mungu amanirini azileri ma ta mbalerisi, te emi’i, emi ku eri ’bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
